    { term: "KPI (Key Performance Indicator)", definition: "KPI is a measurable value that shows how effectively a business is achieving its goals.\nWhy it matters\nTracks performance\nImproves decision making\nAligns team objectives\nExample\nMonthly revenue target is ₹10 lakh.\nRelated terms\nMetrics, Conversion Rate, Revenue\nCTA: Want to define actionable KPIs for your team?" },
    { term: "Keyword Research", definition: "Keyword research is the process of identifying search terms people use on Google to find products, services, or information.\nWhy it matters\nImproves SEO ranking\nDrives targeted traffic\nReduces ad cost\nRelated terms\nSEO, Content Marketing\nCTA: Want us to find high-intent keywords for your business?" }
